Requests

### 

[​

](https://openrouter.ai/docs/api_reference/overview#responses-api-request-format)

Responses API request format

A Responses API request takes `input` (a string or an array of input items), optional `instructions`, and the same routing fields as Chat Completions (`models`, `provider`, `plugins`, `user`). The full request schema is in the [Responses API reference](https://openrouter.ai/docs/api_reference/responses/overview) and the [OpenAPI specification](https://openrouter.ai/docs/api_reference/overview#openapi-specification).

```
{
  "model": "openai/gpt-5.2",
  "instructions": "Answer in one sentence.",
  "input": "What is the meaning of life?",
  "max_output_tokens": 256
}
```

